# OPTIONAL override for scripts/run_teleop.sh - normally NOT needed.
#
# The PICO trackers stream as the full-body 24-joint estimate; the producer
# republishes the joints we use under fixed names (LWRIST/RWRIST/WAIST), which
# are the launcher/consumer defaults. So there are no serials to configure.
#
# Only use this file for the LEGACY individual motion-tracker channel (where
# hardware serials exist): find them with `scripts/run_teleop.sh --probe`
# (wave each limb, note the "<<< MOVING" serial), copy this file to
# scripts/trackers.env and fill in the three values.
TRACKER_LEFT=LWRIST
TRACKER_RIGHT=RWRIST
TRACKER_WAIST=WAIST
